Qwen3.8-27B on TensorFold v0.6.5: TENSORFOLD_MEMORY_RESERVE_GIB may be 0 (the stock floor is 2 GiB), and the stream
memory gate of the dense 27B decoder reads the same variable instead of a fixed 2 GiB. With 0 the budget is all of
MemAvailable. Ported from patch 0004-qwen27-memory-reserve.patch of the Qwen3.8-27B-DGX-Spark-TensorFold recipe
(against v0.6.0, Apache-2.0, a modification of TensorFold by the TensorFold contributors). Applies after 0002.

